==={{initialism}}===
'''LOLZ'''

#{{internet slang}} Variant of [[LOL]] with the ''Z'' serving only to make the acronym look like a plural noun,used by real gamers to show that they find you "nobish" or something funny, or more commonly, sarcastically used; serving as a mockery of those who use the "z" to pluralize other nouns, as opposed to the "s." The mockery of such people is often not done in any kind of specific context, but usually as a way to lighten up a conversation.

